msgctxt "124"
msgid "Get on over to the dining room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Ayako?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "...Okay."
msgstr "...Ok."

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Why didn't you pay Taichi back, Ayako? Did you lose\r\n"
"the money? Or accidentally spend it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr "Ehm..."

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Come on, this isn't like you. When you borrow something from\r\n"
"someone, you have to make sure you give it back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "244"
msgid "I, um..."
msgstr "Io, ehm..."

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Don't be afraid. You can tell me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "...Someone stole it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "What!? One of the other kids?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Are you sure? Maybe it just fell out of your pocket."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "No, I keep all my money in my wallet inside my bag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "(So whoever stole it would have to know it was there.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "All right. I'm gonna get to the bottom of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "No!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Ayako. We have to find out what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "400"
msgid "I'll go round up the others. Wait for me in the dining room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Va bene..."

